{"id":"00338","root":"uni00338_1","name":{"ja":"アンジェ","en":"Ange"},"title":{"ja":"【お色直し】","en":"【Change of Dress】"},"displayName":{"ja":"【お色直し】 アンジェ","en":"【Change of Dress】 Ange"},"aliases":["Angers"],"element":"Science","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","roles":[],"traits":["UFS"],"release":"2020-05-31","limited":true,"characterId":29,"profile":{"ja":"米連の改造人間。魔族や対魔忍の力を移植されている。米連の施設で兵士として育てられ、戦闘経験も多い。集団戦が得意で、背中から無数の触手を出して多数の敵を葬り去る。大人ばかりの環境で育ったせいか、自分の感情を押し殺しがちで、自分の気持ちを素直に口に出すのは苦手である。ある出来事からウェディングドレスに対してあまり良い感情を持っていなかったアンジェ。しかし結婚そのものや結婚式への憧れがなくなったわけではなく、葛藤していた。そんな折、お色直しという文化を知った彼女は、過去との決別のため、また結婚に抱いていた純粋な気持ちを取り戻すため、再びドレスに身を包むことにする。","en":"Ange is a modified human from the United States. Demonic and Taimanin powers have been grafted onto her, and she was raised as a soldier in a U.S. facility, gaining extensive combat experience. She excels in group battles, sprouting countless tentacles from her back to lay waste to hordes of enemies. Growing up among only adults, she tends to suppress her emotions and struggles to speak her feelings openly. After a certain incident, Ange developed a negative attitude toward wedding dresses, though she still longs for marriage and ceremonies, causing inner conflict. When she learned about the \"changing outfit\" culture, she decided to don a dress again—to sever ties with her past and reclaim the pure feelings she once held toward marriage."},"illustrator":"のぶしと","voiceActor":"三十三七","forms":[{"id":"uni00338_1","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1006,2012],"sp":[160,160],"atk":[162,324],"def":[101,202],"spd":[64,64],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":40,"skills":["5","620001"],"evolve":[["evo00013",5],["evo00014",15],["evo00015",5],["evo00017",1]]},{"id":"uni00338_2","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","levelMax":90,"stats":{"hp":[1512,3024],"sp":[230,230],"atk":[259,518],"def":[137,274],"spd":[64,64],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":40,"skills":["5","620001","620002"],"evolve":[["evo00014",10],["evo00015",15],["evo00016",4],["evo0001